actual_result: "Exact whole-source coverage is 100/100/100/100 with 10023 passing tests; static/docstring/security/dependency/public-surface gates, 76 linked tests, Node24/Node26/Bun typed consumers, npx/bunx nine-package smoke and real semantic dogfood pass; historical reliability remains honestly red and broader operator/tag-origin work stays open"
