  "2026-10-09T20:39:42.745Z","harness:codex","Duplicate-check evidence: strict all-status corpus read completed 2912/2912 items with no omissions; request-specific live search plus open and in-progress inventories were reread. Reuse canonical owners pm-2zjs0g and pm-prrlce. The only prior Changeset pm-g0b88h delivers embedding/schema work and is distinct. This record describes the concrete cross-owner delivery and does not duplicate or close their broader future acceptance."
  "2026-10-09T20:41:25.121Z","harness:codex","Verification: canonical full Node24 source suite passed 10023 tests (two Windows-only skips) with exactly 67584/67584 statements, 51690/51690 branches, 13934/13934 functions and 64345/64345 lines. Static quality and source/exported/member docstring coverage each passed unchanged 100% gates; dependency audit and tracked-secret scan passed. An 8868444-byte real distribution was installed in an external temporary consumer: Node24, Node26 and Bun all preserved a repaired original failure and returned a healthy zero on clean data; the strict typed consumer and isolated CLI lifecycle/history verification passed. The package artifact boundary and npx/bunx nine-package acceptance passed. Required live Sentry/telemetry access passed: no recent unresolved fatal/error issues, 2.71% seven-day finish error rate, zero missing-code rows; one-day aggregate returned 4505 finish events and 0.93%. These aggregates are not exhaustive realtime per-action delivery proof. Latest npm pm-changelog 2026.10.5 was installed through the managed project package command."
  "2026-10-09T20:47:38.784Z","harness:codex",Final production adapter historical replay confirms all 28 distinct linked alert issues are reconstructed from API data without a maintained occurrence list. The unchanged linked 76-test command also passes with a recorded focused_tests=76 count measurement. Coverage evidence remains the separate canonical full-run receipt; it is not attached to the focused run as a made-up measurement.
